---
/** The pledge, verbatim. Deep Teal panel, cream type, golden last line. */
---

<blockquote class="quote g8-card g8-card--teal g8-card--shadow">
  <p class="quote__line">
    I promise:<br />To practice when I can.<br />Be kind to myself when I can't.<br />Return
    when I'm able —<br />without guilt.
  </p>
  <p class="quote__line">
    This is my practice.<br />This is my promise.<br />This is my project.
  </p>
  <p class="quote__line quote__line--gold">
    I believe tomorrow<br />can be better than today.
  </p>
</blockquote>

<style>
  .quote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 52px 48px;
  }

  .quote__line {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-family: var(--g8-font-display);
    font-weight: var(--g8-weight-display);
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1.28;
    color: var(--g8-chalk);
  }
  .quote__line:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .quote__line--gold { color: var(--g8-golden-hour); }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .quote { padding: 44px 36px; }
    .quote__line { font-size: 30px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .quote { padding: 32px 26px; }
    .quote__line { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  }
</style>
